One core, no framework coupling. Three need an adapter pattern, three need nothing.

The client is plain TypeScript with no runtime dependencies and no framework coupling. Every
browser API it touches sits behind a typeof guard, so importing it during server rendering is
safe. Only init() needs a browser.

